<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>As used in this article, the following terms have the following meanings:</p><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>“Chief” means the Chief of the Office of Information Security.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>“Office” means the Office of Information Security.</p><p>(c)<span class="EnSpace"/>“Program” means an information security program established pursuant to Section 11549.3.</p></caml:Content>